Right now a workaround is messy, requiring you to do something like...

```gdscript
@abstract class_name InteractStrategy
extends Resource

signal interacted

@abstract func interact(actor: Node2D) -> void

@abstract func emit_interacted() -> void
```

So that other classes are required to implement `emit_interacted` as a function, which hopefully reminds you that there's an important signal to implement.
